# CustomerApi — com.asrevo.cvhome.checkout.api.v1.customer.CustomerApi
#
# The signed-in shopper's own view. STORE-POD.CUSTOMER.* → a shopper token of this store's realm (see
# checkout-api.http for how to obtain SHOPPER_TOKEN); a seller session answers 403.
#
# Requires a running stack: lcl start -d

### my profile (an empty profile carrying only the cua id until the first order)
GET {{SPG_URL}}/checkout/api/v1/private/customer/info?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Authorization: Bearer {{SHOPPER_TOKEN}}

### my orders, newest first
GET {{SPG_URL}}/checkout/api/v1/private/customer/orders?page=0&count=10&store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Authorization: Bearer {{SHOPPER_TOKEN}}

> {% if (response.body.content.length > 0) client.global.set("ORDER_ID", response.body.content[0].id); %}

### one of my orders
GET {{SPG_URL}}/checkout/api/v1/private/customer/{{ORDER_ID}}/order?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Authorization: Bearer {{SHOPPER_TOKEN}}

### its status trail
GET {{SPG_URL}}/checkout/api/v1/private/customer/{{ORDER_ID}}/order/history?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Authorization: Bearer {{SHOPPER_TOKEN}}

### an order that is not mine — 404 (never 403)
GET {{SPG_URL}}/checkout/api/v1/private/customer/1/order?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Authorization: Bearer {{SHOPPER_TOKEN}}

### no token — 401
GET {{SPG_URL}}/checkout/api/v1/private/customer/info?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
